---
---
<section id="projetos" class="mt-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brgreen" data-translate="projects-label">Sliding portfolio</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl" data-translate="projects-title">Projects that impress clients and build trust.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <button data-direction="prev" class="nav-btn rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-3 text-white transition hover:border-brgreen">←</button>
        <button data-direction="next" class="nav-btn rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-3 text-white transition hover:border-brgreen">→</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-6 overflow-x-auto pb-4 scrollbar-thin scrollbar-thumb-brgreen/60 scrollbar-track-transparent">
      <article class="min-w-[320px] snap-start rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/90 p-8 shadow-glow">
        <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-brgreen/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brgreen" data-translate="project-1-label">Residential</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="project-1-title">Smart home with electrical efficiency</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400" data-translate="project-1-description">Design for distribution, lighting and automation to reduce consumption and increase comfort.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li data-translate="project-1-point-1">Smart load distribution</li>
          <li data-translate="project-1-point-2">LED lighting and automation</li>
          <li data-translate="project-1-point-3">Sizing for thermal comfort</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="min-w-[320px] snap-start rounded-[2rem] border border-brgreen/20 bg-brgreen/10 p-8 shadow-glow">
        <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-white" data-translate="project-2-label">Industrial</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="project-2-title">Safe and robust industrial plant</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300" data-translate="project-2-description">Design for reliable operation with protection, monitoring and planned maintenance.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li data-translate="project-2-point-1">Coordinated protection</li>
          <li data-translate="project-2-point-2">Critical redundancy</li>
          <li data-translate="project-2-point-3">Clear technical documentation</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="min-w-[320px] snap-start rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/90 p-8 shadow-glow">
        <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-bryellow/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-bryellow" data-translate="project-3-label">Solar</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="project-3-title">Photovoltaic system for real savings</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400" data-translate="project-3-description">Solar generation design with feasibility analysis and investment optimization.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li data-translate="project-3-point-1">Irradiance study</li>
          <li data-translate="project-3-point-2">Inverter sizing</li>
          <li data-translate="project-3-point-3">Planned financial return</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="min-w-[320px] snap-start rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/90 p-8 shadow-glow">
        <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-brblue/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brblue" data-translate="project-4-label">Automation</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="project-4-title">Automation and process control</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400" data-translate="project-4-description">Control logic, supervision and documentation for industrial environments and smart buildings.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li data-translate="project-4-point-1">Automated flow</li>
          <li data-translate="project-4-point-2">Real-time monitoring</li>
          <li data-translate="project-4-point-3">SCADA integration</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
